{"channelId":"UCsr8vFR9RnrXzbpNk68o3uA","row":["WellSpan Health",4800,"About WellSpan\n________________________________\n\nWellSpan Health is south central Pennsylvania’s most comprehensive health system—serving the region with an extensive network of providers, leading hospitals, health centers, home care and walk-in care centers conveniently located in our local communities. Our mission is to partner with communities and residents to improve health by providing exceptional care that helps our neighbors not only get better but also stay healthy. Our physicians and caregivers work together to help you achieve optimal health. And with MyWellSpan, it’s easier than ever to manage your health online – anytime, anywhere.\nAt WellSpan, our goal is to help you reach your health goals in life.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsr8vFR9RnrXzbpNk68o3uA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsr8vFR9RnrXzbpNk68o3uA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:00.731Z","channelId":"UCsr8vFR9RnrXzbpNk68o3uA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"03ad0a412884aee142d8036a6e5b200986d01837a9216628587e968fca57f0b0","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"ac28fbe11b0bfbc713254e37ced60f0d8b59279680de549268be01fc86c0c0b0"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsr8vFR9RnrXzbpNk68o3uA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:00.731Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsr8vFR9RnrXzbpNk68o3uA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":4800,"raw":"4.8K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsr8vFR9RnrXzbpNk68o3uA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:00.731Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":[]}],